# Design Principles

We prioritize the **impact**, and then the **people**.*

| Platform level                                                                                                              | Spaces level                                                                                                               |
| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| On Alkemio’s global pages, the user should feel inspired, empowered, and activated to connect with others and make a change | Inside the Spaces, the user should intuitively know what to do, feel the progress, feel safe and be empowered to contribute |
| EXPLORE &#124; CONNECT &#124; LEARN                                                                                         | FOCUS &#124; TRUST &#124; PROGRESS                                                                                           |
| LinkedIn, Pinterest …                                                                                                       | GitHub, Figma …                                                                                                             |
## Visual tone
Calm | Professional | Innovative

## Tone of Voice
Friendly | Aspirational | Professional

## Interaction Style
Non-disruptive | Stimulating flow

## Form factors
**Desktop** for full functionality & professional usage

**Mobile** for quick actions & inspiration

**Alkemio places its primary focus on making an impact through collaboration, unlike platforms using an user experience for commercial gain. Of course, Alkemio aims to do so with an amazing experience for every single user.*
